exports[`each template's output > agreement_to_sign, for clients: the snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<title>Sign your updated agreement</title>
<style>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  body, .hd-wrap { background: #0d1117 !important; color: #e6edf3 !important; }
  .hd-muted { color: #9da7b3 !important; }
  a { color: #8cc4ff !important; }
  a.hd-action { background: #e6edf3 !important; color: #0d1117 !important; }
}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">AYA is paused until it&#39;s signed.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">You told us Radiance Med Spa now bills health insurance electronically, yourself or through a clearinghouse. That makes it a covered entity under HIPAA, so the data protection agreement it signed no longer covers it: the business associate agreement does.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Until it&#39;s signed, AYA is paused:</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;"><li>Phone: calls go to your direct line ((415) 555-0100)</li><li>Website chat: shows a contact form</li></ul>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://app.healdesk.test/agreement/AZ3kQm7tR2xV9cK4pL8wN3sJ6hF1dB5gZ0yAeU2iOqXvTkMRk8mW2cQ9vB4nL7pS1dF6hJ3kG8tY5uE0aZxCvBnM1qW" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Sign your updated agreement</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Read it to the end, type your name and sign. Your plan and your settings stay as they are, and AYA answers again the moment it&#39;s signed. The link works for 14 days; after that, sign it from Billing in healdesk, under Your agreement.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If Radiance Med Spa bills no insurance electronically after all, reply to this email and we&#39;ll set it right.</p>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">You&#39;re receiving this because this is the address on Radiance Med Spa&#39;s healdesk account.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">Replies reach the healdesk team. Please leave out your clients&#39; details.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
  "preheader": "AYA is paused until it's signed.",
  "subject": "Sign your updated agreement",
  "text": "You told us Radiance Med Spa now bills health insurance electronically, yourself or through a clearinghouse. That makes it a covered entity under HIPAA, so the data protection agreement it signed no longer covers it: the business associate agreement does.

Until it's signed, AYA is paused:

- Phone: calls go to your direct line ((415) 555-0100)
- Website chat: shows a contact form

Sign your updated agreement: https://app.healdesk.test/agreement/AZ3kQm7tR2xV9cK4pL8wN3sJ6hF1dB5gZ0yAeU2iOqXvTkMRk8mW2cQ9vB4nL7pS1dF6hJ3kG8tY5uE0aZxCvBnM1qW

Read it to the end, type your name and sign. Your plan and your settings stay as they are, and AYA answers again the moment it's signed. The link works for 14 days; after that, sign it from Billing in healdesk, under Your agreement.

If Radiance Med Spa bills no insurance electronically after all, reply to this email and we'll set it right.

—
You're receiving this because this is the address on Radiance Med Spa's healdesk account.
Replies reach the healdesk team. Please leave out your clients' details.
800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States
",
}
`;

