<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If you didn&#39;t mean to disconnect it, connect Stripe again in Settings, under Payments.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://app.healdesk.test/" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Connect Stripe again</a></p>
