}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">The link from your call with healdesk. It adds one device, within 24 hours.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your clinic told us on the phone that no device on its healdesk sign-in can open client details any more. This link lets one phone or computer add its own Face ID, fingerprint or screen lock to the sign-in. Open it on that device.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://app.healdesk.test/recover/Rw7kT2nB5xQ9mV3cL8pZ1sF6dJ4hG0yAeN2uOiXtKqE" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Add a device</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">It works once, for the next 24 hours, and adds one device only. When the device is added, we email this address to say so.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If nobody at your clinic spoke to healdesk about this, don&#39;t use the link. Write a new email to hello@healdesk.io, rather than replying to this one, so the link isn&#39;t copied into it, and we&#39;ll stop it.</p>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">You&#39;re receiving this because this is the address on Radiance Med Spa&#39;s healdesk account.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">To reach the healdesk team, write a new email to hello@healdesk.io rather than replying. Please leave out your clients&#39; details.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
