Add a device: https://app.healdesk.test/recover/Rw7kT2nB5xQ9mV3cL8pZ1sF6dJ4hG0yAeN2uOiXtKqE

It works once, for the next 24 hours, and adds one device only. When the device is added, we email this address to say so.

If nobody at your clinic spoke to healdesk about this, don't use the link. Write a new email to hello@healdesk.io, rather than replying to this one, so the link isn't copied into it, and we'll stop it.

