<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">A call to Radiance Med Spa ended unexpectedly, before AYA and the caller had finished. The caller may want a call back from your team.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">It is marked Ended early in Conversations, where you can see who called and when.</p>
