<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<title>Your healdesk plan is now AYA Voice + Web Chat</title>
<style>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  body, .hd-wrap { background: #0d1117 !important; color: #e6edf3 !important; }
  .hd-muted { color: #9da7b3 !important; }
  a { color: #8cc4ff !important; }
  a.hd-action { background: #e6edf3 !important; color: #0d1117 !important; }
}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">AYA Voice + Web Chat, 500 minutes and 300 conversations, billed monthly.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your healdesk plan is now AYA Voice + Web Chat, 500 minutes and 300 conversations, billed monthly.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Until every channel in it is in service, you&#39;re billed for AYA Web Chat, 300 conversations. Each other channel&#39;s price joins from the day it first answers. A channel that&#39;s ready but waiting on a step of yours joins 30 days after it became ready or after your plan started, whichever is later, and we email you a week before.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The difference in setup fee, $697, was charged with the change, and that&#39;s all the invoice covers: the price you&#39;re billed hasn&#39;t changed.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://invoice.stripe.com/i/acct_testplatform/test_invoice" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">View the invoice</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">To cancel online, sign in at https://app.healdesk.test/ and turn auto-renew off in Billing. Your plan then ends when the period you&#39;ve paid for runs out.</p>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">You&#39;re receiving this because this is the address on Radiance Med Spa&#39;s healdesk account.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">Replies reach the healdesk team. Please leave out your clients&#39; details.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
  "preheader": "AYA Voice + Web Chat, 500 minutes and 300 conversations, billed monthly.",
  "subject": "Your healdesk plan is now AYA Voice + Web Chat",
  "text": "Your healdesk plan is now AYA Voice + Web Chat, 500 minutes and 300 conversations, billed monthly.

Until every channel in it is in service, you're billed for AYA Web Chat, 300 conversations. Each other channel's price joins from the day it first answers. A channel that's ready but waiting on a step of yours joins 30 days after it became ready or after your plan started, whichever is later, and we email you a week before.

The difference in setup fee, $697, was charged with the change, and that's all the invoice covers: the price you're billed hasn't changed.

View the invoice: https://invoice.stripe.com/i/acct_testplatform/test_invoice

To cancel online, sign in at https://app.healdesk.test/ and turn auto-renew off in Billing. Your plan then ends when the period you've paid for runs out.

