<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">You&#39;re receiving this because this is the address on Radiance Med Spa&#39;s healdesk account.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">Replies reach the healdesk team. Please leave out your clients&#39; details.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">Stop these emails: <a href="https://app.healdesk.test/email/stop/MGMxZDJlM2YtMDAwMC00MDAwLTgwMDAtMDAwMDAwMDAwMDAwOmNvbW1lcmNpYWw.TLcKqMnQEtCn3vQBSN9UQqnW4L-5ZRnDlzsRCCoPR6M">https://app.healdesk.test/email/stop/MGMxZDJlM2YtMDAwMC00MDAwLTgwMDAtMDAwMDAwMDAwMDAwOmNvbW1lcmNpYWw.TLcKqMnQEtCn3vQBSN9UQqnW4L-5ZRnDlzsRCCoPR6M</a></p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
  "preheader": "A change to a feature you already have. Nothing for you to do.",
  "subject": "Transcripts arrive by email when a conversation ends",
  "text": "When a call or a website chat ends, AYA emails its transcript to your practice's address on healdesk, over an encrypted connection.

healdesk keeps its copy only until your mail server confirms it has the email, and then deletes it. Conversations in your portal still show how each one ended and whether it led to a booking, with a receipt for each transcript email.

