<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">We&#39;re updating healdesk&#39;s Terms of Service. The new version, 2026-11-20.1, applies to Radiance Med Spa from your first renewal on or after Friday 20 November.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">It changes:</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;"><li>your fees, or how they&#39;re charged</li><li>refunds and the first-month guarantee</li></ul>
