exports[`ops alerts beyond the fixture > a leaving practice with no export delivered: the snapshot 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<title>healdesk ops: URGENT: Deliver this export before the data is destroyed</title>
<style>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  body, .hd-wrap { background: #0d1117 !important; color: #e6edf3 !important; }
  .hd-muted { color: #9da7b3 !important; }
  a { color: #8cc4ff !important; }
  a.hd-action { background: #e6edf3 !important; color: #0d1117 !important; }
}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">URGENT: This clinic&#39;s export must be delivered before its data is destroyed on 30 Nov</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background:#cf222e;color:#ffffff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:4px;">URGENT</span></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;">This clinic&#39;s export must be delivered before its data is destroyed on <strong><mark style="background:#fff3a3;color:#1f2328;padding:0 2px;">30 Nov</mark></strong></p>
<div style="margin:0 0 20px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff8c5;color:#1f2328;border:1px solid #d4a72c;border-radius:6px;"><p style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#1f2328;"><strong>Do this first</strong></p><p style="margin:0;color:#1f2328;">Open the clinic&#39;s <strong><u>Care tab</u></strong> and read <strong><u>Offboarding</u></strong>: the rule, the day the data is destroyed, and whether the export is recorded as delivered.</p></div>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 12px;">
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#57606a;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">More detail</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">No export of its data is recorded as delivered, and its agreement gives thirty days, or it has none on file, so its data is destroyed on the day Offboarding on its Care tab shows, whether or not the export was delivered. Deliver this practice&#39;s export before then: Terms §7 promises every leaving practice one within 30 days of the end, whether or not it asks.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Clinic id:</strong> 0c1d2e3f-0000-4000-8000-000000000000</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Raised:</strong> 6 Oct</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> The email about its cancellation told the practice an export is coming. Once the data is destroyed there is nothing left to export.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;"><strong>Then:</strong><br>2. Ask the practice, on its published number shown under <strong><u>Phone line</u></strong> on its <strong><u>Setup tab</u></strong>, to press Download every record under Conversations in its portal. A download that arrives in full records the export as delivered by itself: that is the safest route.<br>3. Deliver the export yourself only if the practice cannot: the bundle is made on the AWS host by the one-off patient-export task, run from the task script with the clinic&#39;s id, which needs AWS access, so ask the owner to run it. Not the npm command the <strong><u>Offboarding card</u></strong> shows. Hand it over by the secure channel our incident procedure names; producing it records nothing.<br>4. Press <strong><u>Record export delivered</u></strong> under <strong><u>Offboarding</u></strong> on the <strong><u>Care tab</u></strong>, saying how it was handed over, only for a bundle you handed over yourself: the portal download records itself. Do not press it before the practice has the bundle.<br>5. Check <strong><u>Offboarding</u></strong> on the clinic&#39;s <strong><u>Care tab</u></strong>. You are done when it shows Export delivered, before the destruction day.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:16px 0 0;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">Alert code: export_undelivered_before_destruction</p>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">You&#39;re receiving this because this address is set as healdesk&#39;s ops alert address.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">Replies reach the healdesk team. Please leave out patient details.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
  "preheader": "URGENT: This clinic's export must be delivered before its data is destroyed on 30 Nov",
  "subject": "healdesk ops: URGENT: Deliver this export before the data is destroyed",
  "text": "URGENT: This clinic's export must be delivered before its data is destroyed on 30 Nov

DO THIS FIRST: Open the clinic's Care tab and read Offboarding: the rule, the day the data is destroyed, and whether the export is recorded as delivered.

MORE DETAIL

No export of its data is recorded as delivered, and its agreement gives thirty days, or it has none on file, so its data is destroyed on the day Offboarding on its Care tab shows, whether or not the export was delivered. Deliver this practice's export before then: Terms §7 promises every leaving practice one within 30 days of the end, whether or not it asks.

Clinic id: 0c1d2e3f-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Raised: 6 Oct

WHY IT MATTERS: The email about its cancellation told the practice an export is coming. Once the data is destroyed there is nothing left to export.

THEN:
2. Ask the practice, on its published number shown under Phone line on its Setup tab, to press Download every record under Conversations in its portal. A download that arrives in full records the export as delivered by itself: that is the safest route.
3. Deliver the export yourself only if the practice cannot: the bundle is made on the AWS host by the one-off patient-export task, run from the task script with the clinic's id, which needs AWS access, so ask the owner to run it. Not the npm command the Offboarding card shows. Hand it over by the secure channel our incident procedure names; producing it records nothing.
4. Press Record export delivered under Offboarding on the Care tab, saying how it was handed over, only for a bundle you handed over yourself: the portal download records itself. Do not press it before the practice has the bundle.
5. Check Offboarding on the clinic's Care tab. You are done when it shows Export delivered, before the destruction day.

Alert code: export_undelivered_before_destruction

—
You're receiving this because this address is set as healdesk's ops alert address.
Replies reach the healdesk team. Please leave out patient details.
800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States
",
}
`;

