THEN:
2. Open the clinic's Billing tab and look under Parked Stripe events for the subscription's end: an event parked and replayed late is one cause, the host being off is another.
3. Tell the owner, naming the clinic's Care tab and the days late, so the destruction can be brought forward in the database if the owner decides so. Do not change any date yourself.
4. Press Record in the Touch log on the clinic's Care tab to note it. If the clinic's account is already closed, it takes no note: tell the owner what you did instead, with no patient detail. You are done when the owner has decided whether to bring it forward.

